#: ../../../cuemol_style_in_pymol/docs/pymol_cuemol.rst:2
msgid "CueMol-inspired PyMOL styles"
msgstr "CueMol風のPyMOLスタイル"

#: ../../../cuemol_style_in_pymol/docs/pymol_cuemol.rst:4
msgid ""
"``cuemol_style_in_pymol`` is a standalone package that adds molecular geometry and "
"live GPU materials to PyMOL. It requires PyMOL 3.1 with Qt, NumPy, SciPy, and "
"PyOpenGL, and a compatibility OpenGL 2.1 / GLSL 1.20 context. ``pixi install`` "
"installs the development environment, including PyMOL. CueMol and mdtbx are not "
"required. PyMOL's source code and standard commands are unchanged."
msgstr ""
"``cuemol_style_in_pymol`` はPyMOLに分子形状と操作中のGPU材質描画を追加する独立パッケージです。Qt版PyMOL "
"3.1、NumPy、SciPy、PyOpenGL、および互換OpenGL 2.1 / GLSL 1.20コンテキストが必要です。``pixi install`` "
"でPyMOLを含む開発環境を導入できます。CueMolとmdtbxは不要です。PyMOLのソースコードと標準コマンドは変更しません。"

#: ../../../cuemol_style_in_pymol/docs/pymol_cuemol.rst:12
msgid "Quick start"
msgstr "使い始める"

#: ../../../cuemol_style_in_pymol/docs/pymol_cuemol.rst:14
msgid ""
"Run ``pixi install`` in this repository, or install the package into an existing "
"PyMOL Python environment with ``uv pip install "
"\"git+https://github.com/th2ch-g/cuemol_style_in_pymol.git\"``. Register the command "
"from PyMOL's Python console or add these lines to ``.pymolrc.py``:"
msgstr ""
"このリポジトリで ``pixi install`` を実行するか、既存のPyMOL用Python環境に ``uv pip install "
"\"git+https://github.com/th2ch-g/cuemol_style_in_pymol.git\"`` "
"で導入します。PyMOLのPythonコンソールで次の行を実行するか、``.pymolrc.py`` に追記してコマンドを登録します。"

#: ../../../cuemol_style_in_pymol/docs/pymol_cuemol.rst:25
msgid ""
"Importing the package alone does not change PyMOL settings. The optional mdtbx "
"``pymol_plugins`` integration registers the command automatically. After loading a "
"structure, run these commands in the PyMOL command line:"
msgstr ""
"パッケージのインポートだけではPyMOLの設定を変更しません。mdtbxの ``pymol_plugins`` "
"と連携する場合は自動登録されます。構造を読み込んだ後、PyMOLのコマンド欄で次のコマンドを実行します。"

#: ../../../cuemol_style_in_pymol/docs/pymol_cuemol.rst:38
msgid ""
"The default named view is ``cuemol``. Applying another style with the same name "
"replaces that view. ``richardson`` uses thin ribbons, sheet arrows, lighter "
"undersides, stepped lighting, and black silhouette/crease lines. Rotation and zoom "
"update the GPU rendering immediately."
msgstr ""
"既定の管理名は ``cuemol`` です。同じ名前で別のスタイルを適用すると置き換わります。``richardson`` "
"は薄いリボン、シートの矢印、明るい裏面、段階的な陰影、黒い輪郭・折れ目の線を組み合わせます。回転や拡大に合わせてGPU描画が更新されます。"

#: ../../../cuemol_style_in_pymol/docs/pymol_cuemol.rst:43
msgid ""
"The ``richardson`` profile does not implement the hatching strokes in CueMol 3's tone"
" renderer. Its helix outside keeps the base color, while the inside uses a lighter "
"color independently of the preceding ribbon frame."
msgstr ""
"``richardson`` はCueMol 3のtone "
"rendererにあるハッチングの線を実装していません。ヘリックスの外側は基準色、内側は明るい色とし、前のリボンから引き継いだ断面の向きに依存させません。"

